{"id":"vod_sn_38869","vodId":"38869","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"网球优等生第一季","name_cn":"网球优等生第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d5f2bbb0cfc6941a8562cbb72ca415f0.jpg"},"summary":"丸尾荣一郎（村田太志 配音）从小到大都顶着优等生的头衔，学校里五花八门的课业，没有一项是他得不了优等的。可是，即便是这样优秀的荣一郎，也有着弱点，长期坐在桌前学习，导致他的运动量严重不足。为了弥补这一缺憾，荣一郎决定去打网球，就此进入了名为STC的网球俱乐部。　　从刚开始的抗拒到渐渐沉迷，领悟到了网球这一运动独特魅力的荣一郎决定成为一名职业的网球运动员。大大咧咧活泼可爱的鹰崎奈津（寿美菜子 配音）、实力强大技术一流的江川逞（浪川大辅 配音）、立志成为教练的深泽喻吉（下野紘 配音）、天才儿童田岛勇树（优希 配音），在这些志同道合的伙伴们的陪伴下，荣一郎离自己的理想越来越近。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Bbd8SsTuGK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4TeUjcNRDD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rt2Uj7Gcvf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wCGXkvmTQv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SYisQtTyB41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tnxJ2tbLkN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BtVVqGTTky1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VGtvSCrEKU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Evqd57s3s91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GZY5JE3QcB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GUzwbuq5MR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WFMmeXmc6q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UwCFc4pyya1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1CD8DQAkP01/video/index.m3u8"},{"nam